# Three kinds of bytes in this tree, and this file keeps them apart rather than
# putting one licence over the whole thing.  The code, the documents and the
# drawings made here are GPL-3.0-or-later - including ten backgrounds in `media/`
# that the maintainer made.  The vendor's own files are in the tree because every
# claim this project makes about ALPHA's themes is a claim about those exact
# bytes - a reader should be able to hash them - and they are not licensed by
# anyone who has a right to license them.  And one file, named in its own stanza
# below, is a cut of a vendor clip: neither a copy of theirs nor our work from
# scratch, so it gets its own words.  The last paragraph says what was actually
# done to get any of them.

