Copyright: 2026 Tamer Hassan <thameruddin@gmail.com>; these are the maintainer's
 own backgrounds, not the vendor's, named here so the boundary between the three
 kinds of clip in `media/` is written down and not inferred from a directory
 listing
License: GPL-3.0-or-later
 They were measured, not assumed, to be different from the vendored set: none of
 the ten matches any of the 125 files listed in themes/alpha/manifest.json, by
 sha256. Each is pinned by length and digest in tests/test_pinned_metrics.py, and
 its mean luma over every frame it holds is recorded in main.CLIP_LUMA and
 reproducible with tools/clip_luma.py. What this file can hold is the bytes and
 the statement made about them on 2026-11-14, that they are theirs to license;
 what it cannot verify is that sentence, which is a fact about a person.

